From: Mrinohk <5554998+Mrinohk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 10:10:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/31] cuda : fold residual adds into the sm_60 fused rms_norm

One kernel for [add ->] add -> rms_norm -> mul. It stores the sum (the
residual stream) and the normalized output. Outputs may alias inputs only
at the same address, since the allocator often runs these adds in place.
GGML_CUDA_P60_FUSE_ADD=0 disables it.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
